476
00:22:54,780 --> 00:22:58,580
Can you give an example of a situation where you used that skill?

477
00:22:58,580 --> 00:22:59,580
Sure.

478
00:22:59,580 --> 00:23:04,080
Last year, our team faced a situation where several project deadlines were being delayed

479
00:23:04,080 --> 00:23:07,780
