482
00:23:14,280 --> 00:23:19,580
It definitely was, so I decided to analyze the workflow more carefully.

483
00:23:19,580 --> 00:23:24,980
I spoke with team members from different departments to understand how information was being shared.

484
00:23:24,980 --> 00:23:30,380
After gathering that information, I realized that there wasn't a clear communication structure.

485
00:23:30,380 --> 00:23:33,680
So the problem wasn't the people, it was the process.

486
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:38,640
Exactly. Once we identified that issue, I proposed a solution.

487
