505
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,240
That's a very valuable skill.

506
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:54,680
Not everyone can adjust their communication style like that.

507
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:57,960
Yes, and I've learned that effective communication is not

508
00:24:57,960 --> 00:25:03,240
