510
00:25:04,240 --> 00:25:08,520
That's a good point. Listening is often overlooked, but it's essential.

511
00:25:08,520 --> 00:25:14,960
Absolutely. In meetings, I try to listen actively and ask questions if something isn't clear.

512
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:19,300
That helps avoid misunderstandings and ensures that everyone is aligned.

513
00:25:19,300 --> 00:25:24,480
